Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.45,0:59:42.02,Miria-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}R・O・M・A・N・T・I・C
Comment: 0,0:59:39.45,0:59:42.11,Miria-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}R O M A N T I C
