Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.63,1:19:31.42,Anzu-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}嗯～那  那就没办法了…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.63,1:19:31.42,Anzu-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}ん～　しょ、しょうがないなぁ…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.42,1:19:31.74,Kirari-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}好的！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.42,1:19:31.74,Kirari-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}よしっ！
