Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.07,1:19:35.05,灰-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}そんな感じで、今日も
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.05,1:19:35.93,灰-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}Yeah！Yeah！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.05,1:19:35.93,灰-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}イェイ！イェイ！イェイ！
