Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.62,1:20:13.94,灰-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}どうなってんの！？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.94,1:20:15.09,灰-CN,,0,0,0,,呜～～～～哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.94,1:20:15.09,灰-JP,,0,0,0,,う～～～～　ワーッ！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.49,1:20:17.40,Kirari-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}啊  真是的～～
