Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.51,1:29:39.95,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}私達そもそも別人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.95,1:29:41.54,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}乐趣和兴趣也都不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.95,1:29:41.54,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}楽しみも趣味も違うし
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.54,1:29:43.35,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}脑中所想  心中所映
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.54,1:29:43.35,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}頭の中、心の中
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.35,1:29:44.91,Hayate-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}根本是不一样的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.35,1:29:44.91,Hayate-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}それぞれなんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.91,1:29:46.54,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}即便如此还是想了解你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.91,1:29:46.54,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}それでもキミが知りたいし
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.54,1:29:48.15,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}又想要做最真正的自己
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.54,1:29:48.15,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}本当の自分でいたいし
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.15,1:29:49.88,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}要我说的话  不如这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.15,1:29:49.88,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}あとはもうさ、ちゃんとそうだ
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.88,1:29:51.46,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}从正面大胆地上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.88,1:29:51.46,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}真正面からどーん
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.46,1:29:57.29,Hayate-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}这就是'爱'吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.46,1:29:57.29,Hayate-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}これは'アイ'ですか？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.29,1:30:02.28,Nagi-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}不那其实是'你'哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.29,1:30:02.28,Nagi-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}いいえ'ユー'なんです！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.28,1:30:05.55,Hayate-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}…总感觉好不利落诶
